    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Calculators &amp; Construction Hubs</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
      <a href="/calculators/drywell-stormwater" class="block bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
        <div class="font-medium text-gray-900 text-sm">Drywell Stormwater Calculator →</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Calculate roof storm runoff volume, tank count, and washed stone cubic yards.</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/projects/drywell-stormwater-drainage" class="block bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
        <div class="font-medium text-gray-900 text-sm">Drywell Drainage Hub →</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Follow the 4-step workflow: perk testing, geotextile wrap, Flo-Well core, and overflow.</div>
      </a>
      <a href="/calculators/french-drain" class="block bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
        <div class="font-medium text-gray-900 text-sm">French Drain Calculator →</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Calculate trench cubic yards, perforated pipe lengths, and stone backfill.</div>
